{"id":"fde932e35a45d307","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-independent-formula.md","title":"Independent Formula Family","display":"df-independent-formula — Independent Formula Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-independent-formula","aliases":["67-df-independent-formula"],"display":"df-independent-formula — Independent Formula Family","depends_on":["[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"§3 independent formulas; Ch3 independence on complement","source_printed_pages":"31,44","source_pdf_pages":"42,55","source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-independent-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-independent-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-independent-formula — Independent Formula Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"§3 independent formulas; Ch3 independence on complement"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"31,44"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"42,55"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(x)\">\\(\\xi(x)\\)</span> 为至多一个自由变量的算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>数词代入、可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为固定矛盾句。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar k)^i\">\\(\\xi(\\bar k)^i\\)</span> 为下式定义的句法构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Indep}_T\\)</span> 是下式定义的独立族谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\xi(\\bar k)^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\xi(\\bar k),\\qquad\\xi(\\bar k)^1\\coloneqq\\neg\\xi(\\bar k),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\xi,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall s:F\\to\\{0,1\\}\\\nT\\cup\\{\\xi(\\bar k)^{s(k)}:k\\in F\\}\\nvdash\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\xi(\\bar k)^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\xi(\\bar k),\\qquad\\xi(\\bar k)^1\\coloneqq\\neg\\xi(\\bar k),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\xi,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall s:F\\to\\{0,1\\}\\\nT\\cup\\{\\xi(\\bar k)^{s(k)}:k\\in F\\}\\nvdash\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.31 定义 independent，p.44 使用 independent on X^c。有限符号赋值均一致，借一阶紧致性等价于每个无限符号赋值均一致；也等价于该族只能证明重言式命题组合。指数 0/1 的约定与原书一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数词代入、可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]；$\\bot$ 为固定矛盾句。$\\xi(\\bar k)^i$ 为下式定义的句法构造，$i\\in\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(\\bar k)^i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indep}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\xi(\\bar k)^0&\\coloneqq\\xi(\\bar k),\\qquad\\xi(\\bar k)^1\\coloneqq\\neg\\xi(\\bar k),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Indep}_T(\\xi,A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in[A]^{<\\omega}\\ \\forall s:F\\to\\{0,1\\}\\\nT\\cup\\{\\xi(\\bar k)^{s(k)}:k\\in F\\}\\nvdash\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1570,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb6e41357970ae6c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示；$\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]，$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 见 [[67-df-independent-formula]]。"},{"id":"57d3217ac67bc5a6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{ExistsIrred}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]；$\\mathrm{Num}_T$、$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-independent-formula]]。"},{"id":"4acca08be2551459","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T$、$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 与 $\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 分别见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-independent-formula]]、[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-independent-formula]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-independent-formula]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-numeration-existence]]；[[../67-thm-disjoint-numerations]]；[[../67-df-independent-formula]]；[[../67-df-independence-type]]；[[../67-thm-independence-type-realization]]；[[../67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["573b4c635ea6d91f"]}